{"id":"324973ec4b362f39","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-definable-class.md","title":"ZFC Definable Class","display":"df-zfc-definable-class — ZFC Definable Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-definable-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-definable-class"],"display":"df-zfc-definable-class — ZFC Definable Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-definable-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-definable-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-definable-class — ZFC Definable Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_\\in\\in V\">\\(C,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_\\in\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (a set-coded membership-language structure and a distinguished variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefinableClass}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{DefinableClass}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (structure-universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> (formula-set operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (typed satisfaction recursion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[v_0\\mapsto x]\">\\(s[v_0\\mapsto x]\\)</span> (assignments and update, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}definable\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DefinableClass}_S(C,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},\\varphi,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto x])\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}definable\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DefinableClass}_S(C,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},\\varphi,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto x])\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is definability with parameters inside a set-coded structure: the base assignment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> supplies the parameters, while <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is updated with the tested element.</li>\n<li>The satisfaction recursion is selected explicitly, so the definition does not use an unbound model-satisfaction notation. Since <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in V\">\\(C\\in V\\)</span>, this predicate concerns definable subsets of a set-coded universe, not proper classes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (structure predicate, see [[../batch1